          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Large, rapid deliveries of ISR, ISR-processing kits, and networked sensors included in military aid create immediate demand for image/telemetry processing and cloud/edge AI, raising utilization of existing compute infrastructure." />
