          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Large, sustained funding commitments for Ukraine increase fiscal pressure and risk‑appetite constraints among Western backers, prompting insurers to price a higher premium on Gulf routes because underwriters anticipate thinner security guarantees and greater operational risk." />
