          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising shipping and insurance costs feed into higher import prices and add supply‑side and risk premia for trade‑dependent economies, leading investors to demand higher long‑term sovereign yields." />
          <attvalue for="36" value="0-6 months" />
          <attvalue for="37" value="iran_gulf_escalation" />
