          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened chokepoint disruptions delay or block shipments of specialized compute hardware, spare parts and cooling equipment and prevent on‑site repairs, forcing data centers and AI operators to idle capacity and defer workload ramp‑ups." />
