          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained elevated crude futures prices raise domestic energy costs and fiscal pressures in donor countries, increasing political resistance to new large budgetary commitments and thus slowing or shrinking formal funding pledges for the Ukraine effort." />
