          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rapid deployment of autonomous cyber/AI agents that degrade C2, logistics tracking or munitions stock visibility produces urgent battlefield shortfalls and accelerates requests for and deliveries of replacement equipment and munitions." />
